WEBVTT

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.100
Impressive as ever.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.650
Black Wind...

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.440
White Cloud...

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:25.080
The appropriate Soil to use against
you has been decided!

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:55.250
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:55.250
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:02.750
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:02.750
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.860
With our eyes on the future

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.860
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:17.970
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:17.970
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:27.610
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:27.610
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:35.120
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:35.120
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:40.830
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:40.830
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:50.330
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:50.330
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:03.210
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:09.220
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:13.930
The end of the long struggle
through the sea, Teros.

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:21.330
But perhaps there is no end to their journey.

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:26.100
In order to make him grow...

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.650
All hands retreat! Get back to the submarine!

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.850
Ai, Yu! Hurry up and get Lisa up!

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:44.760
Hang on, Lisa!

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:46.250
Lisa!

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:02.410
Lisa!

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:03.840
Thank goodness!

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:06.310
Kaze!

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:21.690
<i>No! Are they really planning on fighting here?</i>

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:24.830
<i>Just like they did twelve years ago...</i>

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.100
Lisa, can you stand up?

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.910
We've got to hurry and get out of here,
things are looking really bad!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.140
Hurry! Hurry!

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:40.210
<i>I never help out in any way.</i>

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:44.750
<i>Dad... Mom...</i>

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.180
Yu!

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:52.130
What are you doing?! Give us a hand!

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:54.500
Okay.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:11.700
Yu!

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:22.920
If you cannot return to your old self
from that time on that day,

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.290
I have no choice but to have you
put back to sleep!

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:31.960
It's not moving.

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:39.710
Partner!

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.810
What's this?! What happened?!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.110
I knew it, it's still broken, kupo!

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.770
How have you been getting it
to move up until now?!

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:52.450
Kupo!

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:55.190
You know, you really are impressive.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:59.960
But now you're being used to help Chaos grow.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.020
How pitiful!

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:08.900
The concerto played by my Mist seduces you.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:10.660
Now sleep!

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:12.800
Concert of the Drawn Sword!

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:25.840
Not good, kupo!

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.820
<i>This same kind of thing happened long ago.</i>

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:37.330
<i>I reached Chaos, and then...</i>

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:02.350
Yu...

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:05.250
Yu is... Yu is...

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.460
I can't believe he wasn't with Chobi.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:10.890
Can't we turn Jane back, Cid?

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.270
I can't really do that right away.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.100
Mr. Kaze, and that weird guy, Moogle,
aren't here either!

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:21.040
What should we do, Knave?

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.480
It's too dangerous to go outside
in these conditions.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:26.950
So you want to just leave Yu to die?!

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:27.640
No, of course not.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:31.350
For now, I'm going to take Jane to a safe place.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.180
Then we can have Chobi and Lou
search for them from the air.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.390
I can't wait that long!

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.390
Calm down, Ai!

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.000
What's this mist?

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:46.130
Mist?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.530
I've got a bad feeling.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.770
Makenshi?!

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.200
Mr. Kaze!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:09.050
The very beating of your hearts
is nurturing Chaos.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:21.760
Well, well... These guys are
becoming quite a pain.

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:26.540
I'm going to have them wander in the
Ocean Puzzle for eternity!

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.310
Pist!

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.540
Your Excellency?!

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:31.410
Pist baby, you idiot!

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:36.110
Do you have any idea how important
the Flying Water is to His Excellency?

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:41.350
Thanks to you, Chaos is growing up
quite well and healthy...

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:45.050
But I can't be having you taking these
independent courses of action.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:46.960
Independent?!

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:53.770
I was under the impression that luring them
to Teros was Your Excellency's challenge.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:54.960
Could it be...

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:57.170
I'm all full!

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.170
<i>Was it Makenshi?!</i>

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:05.700
Mr. Kaze!

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:08.940
He seems to be alive.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:12.180
What you can see is not everything.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:13.920
What?

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:18.520
It began as soon as you entered Wonderland.

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:22.060
Your hearts are raising Chaos.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:26.860
Fear, doubt, hatred, sorrow...

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:32.360
He feeds off of these sad emotions of living
things and converts them into energy.

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:36.280
He is the Earl, the true shape of Chaos.

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:41.210
So are you saying that fear and anxiety
make the Earl happy?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.850
So that's also why the Four Lords
of Gaudium attacked us.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:49.850
That, and also to get him to fire the Magun.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:54.590
He too is no more than a tool
being used by Chaos.

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:58.500
So the reason you attacked our base before...

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.090
Was just to seal the Magun?

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:01.500
No way!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.670
Mister...

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:04.700
You should leave here at once.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.170
Wait! You...

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.480
You... But why?

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:14.850
The reason why his own world was destroyed.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:18.110
He's investigating the Earl and his
henchmen to find that out.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:19.880
Am I wrong?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.850
Won't you fight with us?

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:25.560
There is always going to be fear
and anxiety in our lives.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:30.460
But our hearts can conquer fear, and that's
when the light of our lives starts to shine!

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:33.630
That is the source of our strength.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.630
Isn't that right?!

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:39.370
You are no match for the Earl.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:42.300
So are you telling us to just
sneak away and hide?

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:46.100
Are you sure we can trust your story?

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:50.620
Hurry up and run away.
Get as far away as you can.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:55.120
It looks like we have no choice but to trust you.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.020
My thanks.

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:20.780
Your Excellency!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:26.990
I have brought you a visitor.

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:30.320
Oh, so you're back for a second time?

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.360
Hey, welcome back.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.000
Excuse us, Your Excellency.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.870
It's time for your three o'clock snack.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:47.140
Hello there, Miss Patissier, what great timing.

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.640
For today's snack we tried adding
the essence of impatience

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:52.200
to a little bit of sorrow and envy.

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:57.010
I'm not hungry. Give it to him.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:02.120
But we made this especially for you,
Your Excellency.

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:04.790
We can't just give it to a stranger.

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:08.560
<i>Dad... Mom...</i>

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:20.500
Why?

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:31.740
Hey! Let's hurry and go look for Yu!

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:34.060
Wait just a little while longer.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.220
I'm right in the middle of bringing us
up to the surface,

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:36.920
where the Elenium concentration is low.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.160
Hurry it up already!

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:42.560
If we surface too suddenly,
Jane will smash into pieces.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:56.940
Don't you think you should go over there too?

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:12.220
Lou...

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:17.360
I wonder if Mr. Bolbol is all right?

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:18.920
Probably.

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.570
About your Kigen Arts, Lisa...

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:31.070
With it, can you feel the voice of the Soil?

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:32.850
Voice of the Soil?

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:39.580
<i>I heard it from the Summon after it was
manipulated by Blue Elenium.</i>

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:42.220
<i>There were so many of them.</i>

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:46.030
The voices of the Soil... I felt them then.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:49.960
I think that Soil is the crystallized lives

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:52.660
of the many people who have had
their worlds destroyed.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:54.970
Crystallized lives?

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:59.240
I think perhaps that Mr. Kaze
has fought against Chaos

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:02.900
for the sake of the many lives
that were sacrificed.

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:06.180
For the sake of the many lives...

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.050
All by himself...

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.680
<i>Use it.</i>

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:22.150
<i>My Soil... My Soil!</i>

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:23.750
<i>Aura...</i>

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:35.170
Mr. Kaze!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.680
Mr. Kaze!

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:46.080
Where is White Cloud?

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:49.550
Why are you...

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:55.060
Chaos has now obtained quite a bit of energy.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:58.900
It seems like something
big is about to happen now!

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:02.800
Ocean Puzzle, please move once again!

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:10.400
I've been waiting for you, Makenshi!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:25.920
You weren't serious
when we last fought, were you?

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:30.730
But I have forgotten all about death!

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:32.790
I'll stay the same no matter
how many times you slice me!

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:37.270
It's really too bad for you.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:39.670
I have collected all of the Omega crystals.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:43.570
They are already being
sent back to His Excellency!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:47.380
Are you surprised?

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:51.550
I saw right through that
little plan of yours long ago!

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:57.450
Oh, Chaos!

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:00.550
You're doing quite well, I see!

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:02.450
What's this?

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:05.030
Those are the crystals from Omega.

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:06.030
Omega?!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:10.270
That's right, he's my little toy
that will destroy everything.

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:13.300
Omega is your toy?!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:25.020
If we cause Omega to unite,

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.520
Chaos will not only be able to use
Wonderland for energy,

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:29.790
but also the energy from
the Outside Worlds as well.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:33.290
Omega was once a living creature
in another world,

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:37.200
but with our equipment, we will be able
to control him as we wish.

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:39.160
Incredible!

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:46.260
So you see, enough Flying Water to control
Omega has been delivered to Gaudium.

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:48.440
And because you went on a rampage,

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:52.000
the Ocean Puzzle is now doing better than ever!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:58.210
You talk too much.

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:01.460
No matter what you do, it's too late!

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:05.660
What is that?! Isn't it just an empty bottle?!

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:08.720
Looks like you've finally gone crazy!

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.600
What are you doing?!

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:20.800
I've been turned into Mist!

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:27.310
Play it! Pist!

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:32.250
The Rhapsody of Innocence!

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:48.470
Omega's crystals have totally disappeared!

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.000
What happened?

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.040
It appears as if the movements
of the Ocean Puzzle

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:54.170
have caused them to be
transported away somewhere!

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:56.840
Hurry up and get them back!

00:16:56.840 --> 00:17:00.210
But the Ocean Puzzle no longer exists!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.420
What do you mean?

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:05.780
This appears to be the work of Lord Makenshi.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:21.430
Some kind of giant object is falling down!

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.510
An enemy?! All hands, prepare for battle!

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:26.970
I've got a bad feeling.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.340
It's the Earl's castle, Gaudium!

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.480
They're going to shoot at us.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:03.940
Damn! I don't have enough time!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:16.310
Makenshi!

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:19.750
Play it!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.390
The Chalk Quartet!

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:42.980
Makenshi is protecting us?

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.350
Run!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.080
I don't think so.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:56.660
I'm not letting you get away.
Especially you, Makenshi.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:58.630
Earl...

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:02.190
That's the Earl?!

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.300
That little kid?!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:09.770
You sure did behave yourself for a long time,
didn't you, Makenshi?

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:15.410
I don't believe it. You really think
you can win against me?

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.130
What is that?

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:36.900
What a horrible spirit it has.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:46.900
I hate you guys.

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.650
So I'm going to eat you!

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:01.590
What is this? My strength is being sucked away.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:04.120
I can't stand up.

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:06.330
This is...

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:14.940
<i>White Cloud...</i>

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:24.980
Stop it!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:28.550
Now die!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
Soshite tabi wa hajimaru

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Just the two of us going off

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Kimi to futari doko ka e

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express passes through the night

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express hashirisaru

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Riding into the distance

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Toorisugiru yakei ni

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Let me hear more of your heart

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Motto kokoro kikasete

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Let me close my eyes and be intoxicated

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Hitomi tojite yowasete

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Only the two of us are being taken

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Futari dake wo tsurete ku

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
On this trip that we began with nothing but love

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
Ai dake tsurete tabidatsu

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.600
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.600
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.300
Bring your tired heart

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.300
Tsukareta sono kokoro wo

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.850
Romancing train, whistle again

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.850
Romancing train, whistle again

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.150
It embraces me softly

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.150
Yasashiku daite kureru

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.050
And I know that there is love here

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.050
Ai ga koko ni aru koto

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:30.350
Whisper into my ear until I fall asleep

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:30.350
Nemuru made mimimoto de sasayaite ite

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:35.550
Clouds hang low deep in the night
as the moonlight shines through

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:35.550
Moonlight terasu shinya no
tachikomeru hikui cloud

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.950
I can almost touch it if I reach out,
flying higher than ever

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.950
Kono te nobaseba todokisou
tsukinukete maiagaru hodo

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.650
Yeah, I turn the pages of my book softly
so as not to awaken you

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.650
Yeah yawaraka ni nemuru
kimi okosanai you ni mekuru

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.300
The old words in the paperback
tell a tale of romance

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.300
Paperback furui kotoba tsuzurareta romance

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.050
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.050
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.800
It moves onward with grace

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.800
Susunde yuku yuuga ni

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.400
On the romancing train

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.400
Romancing train futari wa

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.650
Together we seek out beauty

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.650
Utsukushisa wo motomete

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:07.450
Love is watching our dreams

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:07.450
Ai wa yume wo mite iru

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:19.260
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:24.630
Here is my prophecy.

